[{"id":177271229,"discussion_id":"f27742b4754af14838834fda3eb28e295fd654f3","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| matmul | ✅ [*范其瑞*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui), [*林鹏翔*](https://gitcode.com/LinPX) (2/2) | ✅ [*范其瑞*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n zhengyuhao3, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-26T11:37:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T16:12:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177281855,"discussion_id":"88f9b3468fa72abecb1edbb339b1ba312d5a3a69","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `mat_mul_nz2nd_util.h` 中 `Nz2NdMulsAndGatherMask` 函数在 bf16 类型输入为 `inf`（无穷大）时，经 `Muls` 乘法操作后错误地产生 `nan` 结果的问题。核心改动是将 bf16 分支中原本直接对 `bfloat16_t` 类型张量进行的 `Muls` 乘法操作，改为先通过 `ReinterpretCast<int16_t>()` 将张量按 `int16_t` 整数类型重新解释，再执行整数乘法（乘数为 `static_cast<int16_t>(1)`），从而以位等价的整数恒等运算替代浮点乘法，避免硬件在 bf16 浮点乘法路径下将 `inf` 异常转换为 `nan`。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`Nz2NdMulsAndGatherMask` 中 bf16 分支改用 `ReinterpretCast<int16_t>()` + 整数 `Muls`**：新增两行 `LocalTensor<int16_t>` 的 `ReinterpretCast` 声明，并将 `Muls` 调用从 `bfloat16_t` 类型及对应标量 `1.0` 改为 `int16_t` 类型及标量 `1`，以整数乘法替代浮点乘法，确保 bf16 `inf` 值的位模式被原样保留而不被转换为 `nan`。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T12:11:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:11:41+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177282387,"discussion_id":"ef80ba48e8d967fc0febc01924adad57fd51e590","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T12:15:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:15:50+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177401240,"discussion_id":"2338be2c47edef7b7b8fdc970fa3bf4b0dede049","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-27T09:20:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T09:20:00+08:00","user":{"id":"68e9bd35fc10d3370ed73802","login":"zhengyuhao3","object_id":"68e9bd35fc10d3370ed73802","name":"zhengyuhao3","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhengyuhao3"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177401648,"discussion_id":"ffe70abbb8df3b45cdfe618350fef97d6d17ac3d","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=9969453cb6964aa6b4aab46d6551e3a9&projectName=CANN'>9969453cb6964aa6b4aab46d6551e3a9</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitco